        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820950/extras/ae9e97e530f6f6d5b6cd7ff8764c2651.avif?t=1787481938\" width=800 height=374 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realm divided by shifting sands, phantom wars, and peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Heartlands</strong> At the center of the continent lies the bustling cradle of civilization—a sprawling hub of commerce, hunting, and daily life. This is the ancestral home of the Sabres, disciplined warriors who keep the realm safe from dangerous native beasts and maintain order in a thriving trade empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Shifting South</strong> Beyond the trade routes lie the endless southern deserts, a vast expanse cloaked in ancient mystery. Here, colossal stone labyrinths spontaneously emerge from beneath the dunes, swallowing travelers and hiding long-forgotten secrets within their shifting walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fractured North</strong> To the far north, a desperate and secretive war rages against mysterious illusions. An alliance forged in necessity—the Zag mercenaries, enigmatic Sabre Mystics, and battle-hardened Sabre Sentinels holds the line against the Bone Guard and dangerous armies of illusions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you navigate the heartlands and make a living there, conquer the labyrinthine secrets of the south, or march north to join the war against the Illusions, or will you strive to create your own colony and keep to yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sef Saga</strong> invites you to a truly open-ended roleplaying experience, a sandbox game where <strong>your destiny is yours to command</strong>. No two playthroughs are alike, thanks to a <strong>randomized world</strong> that guarantees fresh adventures every time, the life in this world is alive and creates a nice ecobalance for you to enjoy. With <strong>14 diverse skills</strong> to hone all the way to level 50.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820950/extras/d3634335de6b4c77fde8021a6095c732.avif?t=1787481938\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820950/extras_big/d3634335de6b4c77fde8021a6095c732.avif?t=1787481938 width=800 height=910 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > you'll have opportunities to customize your character and playstyle. An innovative <strong>talking system</strong> allows for deep interaction with in-game entities, opening up a wealth of errands, quests, and narrative possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adventures aren't limited to the surface; explore the depths by digging down, reaching the fiery realm of <strong>Magamada</strong> after two descents. Keep an eye out for the enigmatic <strong>Labyrinths</strong> that mysteriously appear in the desert, promising untold treasures to those brave enough to explore them. Embrace the life of a fierce <strong>Hunter</strong>, a peaceful <strong>farmer, mercenary</strong>, a cunning <strong>master trader, </strong>or something else<strong> </strong> – the path you choose is entirely up to you. This ongoing project is designed to offer unparalleled freedom and choice from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820950/extras/242414c24777e88112ecbbcbff9554c0.avif?t=1787481938\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820950/extras_big/242414c24777e88112ecbbcbff9554c0.avif?t=1787481938 width=800 height=448 /></span></p>",
